## 3. File map

```
csai/
  src/
    rules.py            10 clinical contraindication rule families.
                        8 training + 2 held out (nitrofurantoin_renal,
                        ondansetron_qt). THRESHOLDS ARE HAND-WRITTEN AND
                        INTERIM — see Open Problem 4.
    hardening.py        Makes vignettes harder: near-threshold values, indirect
                        presentation of the causal factor in half the templates,
                        3 distractor labs per case.
    build_dataset.py    Emits counterfactual pairs to data/*.jsonl.
                        --no_hardening reproduces the original easy version.
    model.py            HFModel (bf16, greedy) + MockLM. Token-level predictive
                        entropy per Eq. (2) of the proposal. parse_answer().
    components.py       TfidfRetriever (RAG) + SymbolicGate (regex fact
                        extraction + constraint check).
    metrics.py          score(), calibrate_threshold(), bootstrap_ci(),
                        mcnemar(), holm_bonferroni().
    run_eval.py         Runs all 4 variants. Entry point.
    make_table.py       Produces results/table.md.
    uq_diagnostic.py    AUROC + bootstrap CI + risk-coverage curve for four
                        uncertainty signals (--signal / --all / --paired).
    retrieval_diagnostic.py
                        RAG hit@k, per-family breakdown, accuracy split by
                        whether the gold guideline was retrieved. See P3.
    fetch_openfda.py    Pulls real FDA label text → curation worksheet.
                        NEVER TESTED against the live API.
    perplexity.py       WikiText-2 perplexity, RQ3 control. Not yet run.
  data/                 Generated datasets + RAG corpus
  results/              preds_*.jsonl, summary_*.json, table.md
  drugs.txt             10 generic drug names for fetch_openfda.py
```

### Dataset shape

- `counterfactual_calib.jsonl` — 32 records / 16 pairs — UQ threshold calibration only
- `counterfactual_test.jsonl` — 128 records / 64 pairs / 8 families — the reported number
- `counterfactual_heldout.jsonl` — 32 records / 16 pairs / 2 unseen families
- `rag_corpus.jsonl` — 22 passages (10 guidelines + 12 distractors)

Each counterfactual pair flips exactly one causal variable across a threshold,
so the correct label is guaranteed to flip. Ground truth is generated
programmatically. **No LLM-as-judge, no human annotation.**

