## 8. Commands

```bash
cd ~/abtin/paper/csai
export CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0

# build datasets
python src/build_dataset.py --out data

# plumbing check, no GPU
python src/run_eval.py --backend mock --seeds 0 1

# real run
python src/run_eval.py --backend hf --model_id BioMistral/BioMistral-7B \
    --seeds 0 --batch_size 4 2>&1 | tee run.log
python src/make_table.py --split test

# held-out generalisation
python src/run_eval.py --backend hf --model_id BioMistral/BioMistral-7B \
    --seeds 0 --batch_size 4 --split heldout
python src/make_table.py --split heldout

# UQ signal diagnostic (P1)
python src/uq_diagnostic.py --preds results/preds_test_nsai_seed0.jsonl
python src/uq_diagnostic.py --preds results/preds_test_base_seed0.jsonl --all
python src/uq_diagnostic.py --preds results/preds_test_base_seed0.jsonl \
    --paired logit_margin entropy

# retrieval diagnostic (P3)
python src/retrieval_diagnostic.py --preds results/preds_test_rag_seed0.jsonl \
    --compare results/preds_test_base_seed0.jsonl

# real FDA labels (never yet run successfully)
export OPENFDA_API_KEY='...'
python src/fetch_openfda.py --drugs drugs.txt --out data/curation_worksheet.csv

# RQ3 control, not yet run
python src/perplexity.py --model_id BioMistral/BioMistral-7B
```

`make_table.py` overwrites `results/table.md` each time. Copy finished tables to
`results/table_{split}_final.md`.

**Both table files are currently corrupt.** `results/table.md` and
`results/table_heldout_final.md` contain run-log output (weight-loading progress
bars and per-seed lines), not markdown tables — a `tee` redirect went to the
wrong path. The numbers themselves are safe in `results/summary_test.json` and
`results/summary_heldout.json`; re-run `make_table.py` to regenerate.

See `BACKLOG.md` for the done/remaining breakdown against the proposal's four
Aims and the supervisor's four requirements.

